[{"id":164238660,"discussion_id":"3c14f75d72d428ccd1266082f352f3227b340840","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-transformer/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| attention | ✅ [*yu-xinjie62*](https://gitcode.com/yu-xinjie62), [*cc-z*](https://gitcode.com/cc-z) (2/2) | ✅ [*yu-xinjie62*](https://gitcode.com/yu-xinjie62), [*cc-z*](https://gitcode.com/cc-z) (2/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n","created_at":"2026-03-04T12:58:11+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-09T11:01:08+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164238670,"discussion_id":"588b9f25b8fab7b393c241071238af8f64e8e915","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-04T12:58:17+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-04T12:58:17+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164238712,"discussion_id":"e4f6b50fa7fd0674f0384270040d8482aeae7294","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR主要修复了LightningIndexerGrad算子在确定性模式下的多个核心逻辑错误与性能问题。首先，修复了分片计算中`dkCoreSize`公式错误包含`batch`维度，以及工作空间大小计算误用`aivNum`而非`aicNum`的问题，这可能导致内存访问越界或计算资源分配错误。其次，修复了确定性模式下梯度计算内核中每核工作空间大小初始化和使用的错误，可能导致内存访问越界或数据覆盖。最后，优化了确定性合并函数的内存使用，通过分块处理解决了处理大规模数据时统一缓冲区容量不足的风险，并提升了数据拷贝效率。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改方案包含三部分核心修正。第一，修正分片数据结构`tilingData_`中`dkCoreSize`的计算公式（从`batch * seqlenK * headDim`改为`seqlenK * headDim`），并在计算`dkCore`工作空间总大小时将乘数从`aivNum`修正为`aicNum`。第二，在梯度计算内核中，正确使用`dkCoreSize`来初始化和重置每核工作空间，确保内存访问边界准确。第三，重构`DeterministicMerge`函数，引入分块处理逻辑以降低对统一缓冲区的瞬时占用，提升内存使用效率和健壮性。此外，为支持上述修改，在`LIGTilingData`类中新增了`dkCoreSize`成员变量及其访问器。","created_at":"2026-03-04T12:59:58+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-04T12:59:58+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164238718,"discussion_id":"d5e0ce3196485dc46f363b0fff1ad953481cbd9c","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-04T13:00:04+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-04T13:00:04+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164251428,"discussion_id":"a3faff0f9d898369712146546a0722339804972a","body":":large_blue_circl